{"speciesId":773,"names":{"fr":"Silvallié","es":"Silvally","en":"Silvally","ja":"シルヴァディ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"La confiance qu’il place en son Dresseur a réveillé ses pouvoirs. Il est à présent capable de changer de type à loisir durant le combat."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"La confianza con su Entrenador ha despertado su potencial. Ahora es capaz de cambiar de tipo a voluntad durante el combate."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Its trust in its partner is what awakens it. This Pokémon is capable of changing its type, a flexibility that is well displayed in battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"パートナーとの 信頼で 覚醒。 自在に タイプを チェンジする 能力を 発揮し 戦う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Son nom lui a été donné par le jeune homme qui a le premier réussi à faire évoluer Type:0."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Debe su nombre al joven que hizo evolucionar por primera vez a Código Cero para que adquiriese este aspecto."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Although its name was Type: Null at first, the boy who evolved it into this form gave it the name by which it is now known."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"その名は タイプ：ヌルを 初めて この姿に 進化 させた 少年に よって 名づけられた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Il a réveillé tout son potentiel et a évolué. Briser son lourd masque a décuplé sa vitesse."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Esta es la forma que adopta tras evolucionar y despertar todo su potencial. Al deshacerse de su máscara, su velocidad ha aumentado mucho."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"This is its form once it has awakened and evolved. Freed from its heavy mask, its speed is greatly increased."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"覚醒し 進化した 姿。 重い マスクから 解き放たれ スピードが 大幅に アップ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il a réussi à briser son masque grâce à la force mentale qu’il a acquise en établissant un lien puissant avec son Dresseur."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Se ha liberado de la máscara de contención gracias a su fortaleza mental, fruto del estrecho vínculo con su Entrenador."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Through the bond it formed with its Trainer, its will was strengthened, and it was able to destroy its control mask."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"制御マスクを 破壊 できたのは パートナーとの 絆に よって 強い 精神力を 得たからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Un lien fort avec son Dresseur lui a permis de libérer tout son potentiel. Il peut changer de type à volonté."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Gracias a los fuertes vínculos que lo unen a su Entrenador, ha despertado todo su potencial. Es capaz de cambiar de tipo a voluntad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"A solid bond of trust between this Pokémon and its Trainer awakened the strength hidden within Silvally. It can change its type at will."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"パートナーとの 強い 絆により 秘めた 能力が 覚醒した。 自在に タイプを 変えられる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"La relation de confiance qui le lie à son Dresseur est le facteur décisif qui lui permet de libérer tout son potentiel."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"El factor decisivo que le ha permitido liberar toda su fuerza ha sido el estrecho vínculo y la confianza que profesa a su Entrenador."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The final factor needed to release this Pokémon’s true power was a strong bond with a Trainer it trusts."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"本来の 力を 解き放つ 最後の ファクターは 信頼する トレーナーとの 絆 だった。"}],"varieties":[{"id":773,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[17,"level-up",70],[18,"level-up",70]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"tackle","learns":[[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[17,"level-up",40],[18,"level-up",40],[20,"level-up",